<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

<p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> 25 May 2025</p>

<p>
Welcome to DuaAjan. Your privacy is important to us.
This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use,
store and protect your information when using our services.
</p>

<h2>About DuaAjan</h2>

<p>
DuaAjan allows users to listen to live Ajan broadcasts
from participating mosques and receive notifications
for selected mosques.
</p>

<h2>Information We Collect</h2>

<ul>
<li>Mobile Number</li>
<li>OTP Verification Data</li>
<li>Selected Mosque Preferences</li>
<li>Notification Preferences</li>
<li>Device Information</li>
<li>Crash Logs & Diagnostics</li>
</ul>

<h2>How We Use Information</h2>

<ul>
<li>Create and manage accounts</li>
<li>OTP verification</li>
<li>Deliver live Ajan broadcasts</li>
<li>Improve performance and reliability</li>
<li>Provide support</li>
<li>Prevent fraud and misuse</li>
</ul>

<h2>Information Sharing</h2>

<p>
We do not sell, rent, or trade personal information.
Data may only be shared with trusted service providers,
payment processors, hosting providers, analytics providers,
or when required by law.
</p>

<h2>Data Security</h2>

<p>
We implement reasonable administrative and technical
security measures to protect user information.
</p>

<h2>User Rights</h2>

<ul>
<li>Access your information</li>
<li>Correct inaccurate information</li>
<li>Request account deletion</li>
<li>Withdraw permissions</li>
</ul>

<h2>Permissions Used</h2>

<ul>
<li>Internet Access</li>
<li>Notifications</li>
</ul>

